<h3>You've been invited to <%= @workspace.name %></h3>

<p><strong><%= @invited_by.email %></strong> has invited you to join their workspace on ugo.cr as a <strong><%= @invitation.role %></strong>.</p>

<p>Sign in to your existing account or create a new one to accept the invitation.</p>

